TODO.local.md
AI Manufacturing Project Guide
🤔 Samajh Nahi Aaya — Thoda Clear Karo!
Aapne likha "gigiore" — ye kya matlab hai? Mujhe samajh nahi aaya. 😅

Aap kya karna chahte ho? Neeche se batao:

❓ Kya Aap Ye Chahte Ho?
Option 1: .gitignore file chahiye?
Aap "gitignore" likhna chahte the?
👉 Bolo — main complete .gitignore file ka content de doon

Option 2: README file dobara chahiye?
Pichle message me 500+ lines ka README diya tha.
👉 Bolo — main phir se paste kar doon (ya chhota version doon)

Option 3: Push command ka output aaya error?
Aapne git push chalaya aur kuch error aaya?
👉 Error message paste karo — main fix bataunga

Option 4: Kuch aur?
Aap jo kehna chahte ho, poora sentence me likho — Hindi ya English, koi bhi. Main samajh jaunga. 😊

📋 Current Status (Yaad Rakho)
Step	Status
✅ Git init	Done
✅ Project folder structure	Done
⚠️ First commit	Done (but .env/.db galat commit hue)
❌ Remote URL	Galat tha (YOUR_USERNAME)
❌ Push	Fail hua
⏳ README update	Pending
🎯 Ab Mujhe Sirf Ye Batao
Apne terminal me ye 2 commands chalao aur output paste karo:

bash
git status
git remote -v
Ye output dekh ke main exact next step bataunga. 🚀

Ya phir — seedha bolo "README chahiye" / "gitignore chahiye" / "backend code chahiye" — jo chahiye woh bolo. 😊

gitignore code
📄 .gitignore File — Complete Code
Aapke project root me file kholo:
C:\Users\HP\ai-global-manufacturing-ecosystem\.gitignore

Poora neeche wala content paste karo (purana content replace karo) → Save karo ✅

✅ Complete .gitignore Code
